==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Octorok Tentacles are dropped by all types of [[Octorok]]s when defeated. Like other [[Monster Part]]s, they cannot be used for [[Cooking]], but can still be combined with critters in a [[Cooking Pot]] to make [[Elixir]]s.<ref name="BotW Inventory" /> They can also be exchanged for [[Mon]] at the [[Fang and Bone]] or used for Light Blue [[Dye]] at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

Octorok Tentacles are required to [[Enhancing|Enhance]] the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:
{{Material Armors|BotW|Octorok Tentacle}}

==={{TotK|-}}===
Octorok Tentacles are once again dropped by [[Octorok]]s in {{TotK}}.<ref name="TotK Inventory" /> Due to their acidic taste, they are inedible, though they are highly valued for their utility in [[Cooking]] [[Elixir]]s with critters in [[Cooking Pot]]s or [[Portable Pot]]s.<ref name="TotK Inventory" />

Octorok Tentacles are required to upgrade the following pieces of [[Armor]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]:
{{Material Armors|TotK|Octorok Tentacle}}

